Next architectural frontier: A system that doesn’t simply possess different cognitive capabilities, but learns when to summon each one, how to combine them, and when to hand control back.

That’s how the Pantheon starts moving from a taxonomy of intelligence toward an adaptive ecology of intelligence. 🤜🏻